# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Per-finding research rounds. 500+ local folders of specs, frozen configs,
# derived data and scratch. None of it is distributed: the replication package
# names the folders and documents how to rebuild them from the raw stores.
# Code that ships with a post is added deliberately (git add -f), which is why
# borrow_easy_control_2026-07-26/code and flex_blindspot_2026-07-26/code stay
# tracked -- an ignore rule never un-tracks something already committed.
posts/claim_tests/

# Local research byproducts, regenerable from the scripts that made them
data/married_census_rebuilt/
data/occ/
code/data_pipeline/

# Private working documents are NOT listed here on purpose. Naming them in a
# public .gitignore advertises their filenames to anyone who clones. They live
# in .git/info/exclude instead, which is local-only. The categorical rules in
# this file (data extensions, research rounds) are the ones that protect the
# repo regardless of who or what is committing, so those stay here.

# Generated ticker-key images: produced by export_reddit alongside the platform
# copies, meaningless without them
**/figures/ticker_legend_*.png

# Derived binary data. Nothing of these types has ever belonged in the repo; the
# replication package documents how to rebuild them from the raw stores.
*.parquet
*.npz
*.npy
*.pkl
*.feather
**/cache/
